  "description": "eeCLOUD is a high-performance data engine for .NET 8 built around a logical Memory model instead of a traditional ORM schema. It combines high-throughput Raw JSON persistence with batched Object Graph storage for nested models, automatic database and memory bootstrap, clustering, reference indexing, date-range queries, mixed Raw JSON/V4 compatibility, SFTP binary storage, and optional eeCACHE acceleration across PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server, SFTP and local cache backends. Optional per-instance telemetry exposes standard .NET metrics and traces compatible with OpenTelemetry, independently of the storage backend. It is designed for backend systems that need flexible data structures, rapid delivery and strong runtime performance without heavy ORM configuration.",
