  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "eeCLOUD 4.3.0 introduces optional, backend-independent telemetry for Application instances.\n\nHighlights in this release:\n- Added EnableTelemetry(TelemetryOptions) with a disposable registration and independent metrics/tracing switches.\n- Instrumented all 86 public asynchronous Application overloads using standard .NET ActivitySource and Meter sources named eeCLOUD.\n- Added operation counts, duration histograms, in-flight operation counts and response record counts, grouped by instance, operation and outcome.\n- Correlated activities with the caller's trace context without exporting payloads, credentials or query values.\n- Kept telemetry collection and export in the host application, with no new package dependencies or backend-specific settings.\n- Documented OpenTelemetry integration and added local regression checks for telemetry coverage, isolation, lifecycle, concurrency and outcomes.",
